(7297259, 1138006, 150277, '<td valign="top">I felt really sad looking at this image.  There seems to be a lot in those eyes (emotion, instrospection?).  I hope this woman is well loved.  I wondered if a crop zooming in on that gorgeous face might have made for an even stronger composition?</td>', 'I felt really sad looking at this image.  There seems to be a lot in those eyes (emotion, instrospection?).  I hope this woman is well loved.  I wondered if a crop zooming in on that gorgeous face might have made for an even stronger composition?', '2014-12-31 15:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
