(7298129, 1137929, 173844, '<td valign="top">The wonderful colors, in light of the dearth of visual particulars of the face, elicit a portrait expressed in emotion and feeling.  Beautifully done.</td>', 'The wonderful colors, in light of the dearth of visual particulars of the face, elicit a portrait expressed in emotion and feeling.  Beautifully done.', '2015-01-03 10:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
