(7298133, 1138011, 173844, '<td valign="top">The reflection, with eye in sharp focus, contends with the actual child for preeminence.  Nice blocks and gradations of tone.</td>', 'The reflection, with eye in sharp focus, contends with the actual child for preeminence.  Nice blocks and gradations of tone.', '2015-01-03 10:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
