(7298186, 1137817, 37858, '<td valign="top">A top five image IMHO.  Nice interaction with the waiter and the photographer.</td>', 'A top five image IMHO.  Nice interaction with the waiter and the photographer.', '2015-01-03 13:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298187, 1138006, 37858, '<td valign="top">A top five image IMHO.  Love the vacant eyes and sad demeanor.  The toy suggests a hospital setting with someone in the O.R.  Good story encapsulated in this image.</td>', 'A top five image IMHO.  Love the vacant eyes and sad demeanor.  The toy suggests a hospital setting with someone in the O.R.  Good story encapsulated in this image.', '2015-01-03 13:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298188, 1137963, 37858, '<td valign="top">A top five image IMHO.  Certainly captures the essence of "good times".  The expressions are natural (as a candid shot would be).  Nice DoF to isolate the two men but still show the setting.</td>', 'A top five image IMHO.  Certainly captures the essence of "good times".  The expressions are natural (as a candid shot would be).  Nice DoF to isolate the two men but still show the setting.', '2015-01-03 13:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298189, 1138004, 37858, '<td valign="top">A top five image IMHO.  Great interaction suggested by the girl''s eyes, smile, and slight angle to her dog as she runs.  Good, clean diagonal line in the background to let my eye wander past them to the setting.  Having a cute hat and a cute dog, doesn''t hurt any either.</td>', 'A top five image IMHO.  Great interaction suggested by the girl''s eyes, smile, and slight angle to her dog as she runs.  Good, clean diagonal line in the background to let my eye wander past them to the setting.  Having a cute hat and a cute dog, doesn''t hurt any either.', '2015-01-03 13:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298191, 1137935, 37858, '<td valign="top">A top five image IMHO.  What takes this above most of the other images in the challenge, for me, is the use of light in the way it is contained by his hands, face, and jacket.  It gives warmth to the point of interest and lets the rest of the photo fall into darkness.  Well done.</td>', 'A top five image IMHO.  What takes this above most of the other images in the challenge, for me, is the use of light in the way it is contained by his hands, face, and jacket.  It gives warmth to the point of interest and lets the rest of the photo fall into darkness.  Well done.', '2015-01-03 13:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298192, 1137663, 37858, '<td valign="top">I like the use of light and shadow in this image.</td>', 'I like the use of light and shadow in this image.', '2015-01-03 13:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298193, 1137985, 37858, '<td valign="top">Just a fun image.</td>', 'Just a fun image.', '2015-01-03 13:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298196, 1137894, 37858, '<td valign="top">I like this image for its complexity, and because it is fun to figure out what is going on in the reflections.  ...besides, the guy is a Patriots fan, so that lifts the image up a notch more.</td>', 'I like this image for its complexity, and because it is fun to figure out what is going on in the reflections.  ...besides, the guy is a Patriots fan, so that lifts the image up a notch more.', '2015-01-03 13:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
