(7298232, 1137962, 173844, '<td valign="top">Ethereal and moving.  The postures are elegant, the movement wonderfully understated, the man''s face so appealing.  Admirable admixture of quasi-high key and quasi-low key.  NYPD t-shirt --  perfect final touch.</td>', 'Ethereal and moving.  The postures are elegant, the movement wonderfully understated, the man''s face so appealing.  Admirable admixture of quasi-high key and quasi-low key.  NYPD t-shirt --  perfect final touch.', '2015-01-03 13:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
