(7298543, 1138011, 177322, '<td valign="top">Ah, innocent fascination.  B&amp;W was a nice choice to direct the viewer to  his/her intense captivation.  The reflection does a good job of finishing the face.</td>', 'Ah, innocent fascination.  B&W was a nice choice to direct the viewer to  his/her intense captivation.  The reflection does a good job of finishing the face.', '2015-01-04 10:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298545, 1138003, 177322, '<td valign="top">Well composed photojournalism shot.  The look on the subject''s face, the setting, the reflections of other passengers, the sign, the newspaper all lend to many elements that engage the viewer. Interesting textures in all the fabrics nicely accented in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Well composed photojournalism shot.  The look on the subject''s face, the setting, the reflections of other passengers, the sign, the newspaper all lend to many elements that engage the viewer. Interesting textures in all the fabrics nicely accented in B&W.', '2015-01-04 10:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298546, 1138006, 177322, '<td valign="top">Powerful image: so sad, I nearly wept.</td>', 'Powerful image: so sad, I nearly wept.', '2015-01-04 10:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298549, 1137890, 177322, '<td valign="top">First impression: eerie then cheery.  The grainy B&amp;W portion of the image is almost sinister then there is this bright, industrious lady sweeping away. Had it not been for the selective saturation, this would have probably been a ho-hum image; the artistic editing makes it a compelling one.  Effective composition. A most interesting submission.</td>', 'First impression: eerie then cheery.  The grainy B&W portion of the image is almost sinister then there is this bright, industrious lady sweeping away. Had it not been for the selective saturation, this would have probably been a ho-hum image; the artistic editing makes it a compelling one.  Effective composition. A most interesting submission.', '2015-01-04 10:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298552, 1138004, 177322, '<td valign="top">Delightful capture of a carefree child and her puppy! This stop-action shot freezes ( no pun intended ) the happy energy of both.  Quite a pleasing shot!  Compositionally, I personally would have cropped down the top to the hard white horizon - but that would be, again, a personal preference.</td>', 'Delightful capture of a carefree child and her puppy! This stop-action shot freezes ( no pun intended ) the happy energy of both.  Quite a pleasing shot!  Compositionally, I personally would have cropped down the top to the hard white horizon - but that would be, again, a personal preference.', '2015-01-04 10:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298554, 1137931, 177322, '<td valign="top">A most novel image. The title might suggest it should be the horse in focus not the sulky driver, but without the bias of the title, I like the sharpness of the driver''s face that suggests he is reading the animal as much as the creature is waiting for its cue.  Quite a unique moment.</td>', 'A most novel image. The title might suggest it should be the horse in focus not the sulky driver, but without the bias of the title, I like the sharpness of the driver''s face that suggests he is reading the animal as much as the creature is waiting for its cue.  Quite a unique moment.', '2015-01-04 10:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298555, 1137953, 61396, '<td valign="top">great scene, good angle to make the viewer stay a little longer, and processing is not too bad either</td>', 'great scene, good angle to make the viewer stay a little longer, and processing is not too bad either', '2015-01-04 10:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298556, 1138011, 61396, '<td valign="top">well reflected</td>', 'well reflected', '2015-01-04 10:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
