(7298700, 1137837, 119419, '<td valign="top">My pick for the top, follows all the technical conventions effortlessly and with transparence yet transcends to the realm of artistry that is a delight to engage within. A golden egg ;)</td>', 'My pick for the top, follows all the technical conventions effortlessly and with transparence yet transcends to the realm of artistry that is a delight to engage within. A golden egg ;)', '2015-01-04 19:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
