(7298704, 1137975, 119419, '<td valign="top">As close as it gets to purity of emotion. A split second expression and juxtaposition that creates the use of an artistic paradox; what was, what you made it and my subjective experience upon seeing it.</td>', 'As close as it gets to purity of emotion. A split second expression and juxtaposition that creates the use of an artistic paradox; what was, what you made it and my subjective experience upon seeing it.', '2015-01-04 19:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
