(7298780, 1137906, 13077, '<td valign="top">Well composed, and good job capturing both detail in his attire (the only word I''ve heard used is man-dress but I''m sure it''s called something else) and in the shadows.<br/>It would be stronger with a crop, mainly to remove the little intruding black shape at the far top-left. I would probably crop it maybe half an inch over the top of his head though.</td>', 'Well composed, and good job capturing both detail in his attire (the only word I''ve heard used is man-dress but I''m sure it''s called something else) and in the shadows.It would be stronger with a crop, mainly to remove the little intruding black shape at the far top-left. I would probably crop it maybe half an inch over the top of his head though.', '2015-01-04 22:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298781, 1137985, 13077, '<td valign="top">From the onlookers and the lady taking a picture it seems like a significant event, whether it was or not.</td>', 'From the onlookers and the lady taking a picture it seems like a significant event, whether it was or not.', '2015-01-04 22:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298782, 1137892, 13077, '<td valign="top">In-focus, good faces and well processed. A good candid, would make a good newspaper filler shot.</td>', 'In-focus, good faces and well processed. A good candid, would make a good newspaper filler shot.', '2015-01-04 22:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298783, 1137930, 13077, '<td valign="top">It works fairly well as a high-key shot, but the intrusive highlights sort of chop of part of his forehead. Depending on how low the ISO was and if it was shot in RAW, you might''ve been able to keep that from happening and still kept the pure white background. The detail in the eyes is good, but they could probably have been brightened a bit, since eyes tend to make a portrait.</td>', 'It works fairly well as a high-key shot, but the intrusive highlights sort of chop of part of his forehead. Depending on how low the ISO was and if it was shot in RAW, you might''ve been able to keep that from happening and still kept the pure white background. The detail in the eyes is good, but they could probably have been brightened a bit, since eyes tend to make a portrait.', '2015-01-04 23:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298785, 1138003, 13077, '<td valign="top">The lady next to you was chimping your photo on the LCD screen wasn''t she?<br/>Pretty much perfect for the challenge; should do well.</td>', 'The lady next to you was chimping your photo on the LCD screen wasn''t she?Pretty much perfect for the challenge; should do well.', '2015-01-04 23:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298786, 1137972, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely sharp in the eyes while maintaining a soft feel overall, nicely done. Portrays the anxiety of such places well.</td>', 'Nicely sharp in the eyes while maintaining a soft feel overall, nicely done. Portrays the anxiety of such places well.', '2015-01-04 23:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298787, 1137951, 13077, '<td valign="top">Good colors and well composed. I like how the detail in his guitar is visible in the shadow from his arm.<br/>Strikes me as a dennisheckman style photo, but I don''t think it''s his because it''s not sleeveless shirt weather in Colorado right now.</td>', 'Good colors and well composed. I like how the detail in his guitar is visible in the shadow from his arm.Strikes me as a dennisheckman style photo, but I don''t think it''s his because it''s not sleeveless shirt weather in Colorado right now.', '2015-01-04 23:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298788, 1137862, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like it. Good detail in the subject''s face and just the right amount shown of the man he is talking to.<br/>Would be a good journalistic shot with an accompanying caption.</td>', 'I like it. Good detail in the subject''s face and just the right amount shown of the man he is talking to.Would be a good journalistic shot with an accompanying caption.', '2015-01-04 23:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298789, 1137849, 13077, '<td valign="top">Sure looks like a character.<br/>Has the makings of a good candid, but very hard to look past the motion blur.</td>', 'Sure looks like a character.Has the makings of a good candid, but very hard to look past the motion blur.', '2015-01-04 23:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298790, 1137911, 13077, '<td valign="top">A cute kiddo, and looks like he''s having a great time.<br/>The focus seems to have locked on the metal stuff in front of him, - his face is decently sharp though.</td>', 'A cute kiddo, and looks like he''s having a great time.The focus seems to have locked on the metal stuff in front of him, - his face is decently sharp though.', '2015-01-04 23:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298791, 1137983, 13077, '<td valign="top">A very safe, relaxed vibe accompanies this photo. A well caught moment, the softness and grain add to it.</td>', 'A very safe, relaxed vibe accompanies this photo. A well caught moment, the softness and grain add to it.', '2015-01-04 23:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298793, 1137963, 13077, '<td valign="top">Wow, that looks tricky. Well caught expressions, the bit of motion blur isn''t really a problem to me.</td>', 'Wow, that looks tricky. Well caught expressions, the bit of motion blur isn''t really a problem to me.', '2015-01-04 23:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298794, 1137950, 13077, '<td valign="top">A good candid portrait of several (looks like) family members. Nicely done balancing the fill light, background light and the candle.</td>', 'A good candid portrait of several (looks like) family members. Nicely done balancing the fill light, background light and the candle.', '2015-01-04 23:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298795, 1137973, 13077, '<td valign="top">She looks about ready to fall asleep. Sure is an interesting bit of headgear though.</td>', 'She looks about ready to fall asleep. Sure is an interesting bit of headgear though.', '2015-01-04 23:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298796, 1137897, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice - sharp, well composed/cropped. Good detail in her eyes too - as far as the candid part, maybe a little late for that since she''s already starting to pose (smile at least)</td>', 'Nice - sharp, well composed/cropped. Good detail in her eyes too - as far as the candid part, maybe a little late for that since she''s already starting to pose (smile at least)', '2015-01-04 23:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298797, 1137953, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the shapes when seen from this angle.</td>', 'I like the composition and the shapes when seen from this angle.', '2015-01-04 23:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298798, 1137868, 13077, '<td valign="top">Looks like the focus was on the back of her shoulders rather than her face.</td>', 'Looks like the focus was on the back of her shoulders rather than her face.', '2015-01-04 23:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298799, 1137870, 13077, '<td valign="top">Summer/must be Australia then?<br/> <br/>A good capture, fun and enjoyable vibe.</td>', 'Summer/must be Australia then? A good capture, fun and enjoyable vibe.', '2015-01-04 23:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298800, 1137931, 13077, '<td valign="top">A good concept for a storytelling shot, but hard to pull off - you''ve done pretty well. Tough because the horse is a lot bigger and to have him in the foreground but the focus on the man means a lot of the frame will be out of focus. Since it''s a shot that has to be viewed fairly large to appreciate, having most of it out of focus is a little strange. I think you did about as well as could''ve been done as a candid, journalistic shot.</td>', 'A good concept for a storytelling shot, but hard to pull off - you''ve done pretty well. Tough because the horse is a lot bigger and to have him in the foreground but the focus on the man means a lot of the frame will be out of focus. Since it''s a shot that has to be viewed fairly large to appreciate, having most of it out of focus is a little strange. I think you did about as well as could''ve been done as a candid, journalistic shot.', '2015-01-04 23:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298801, 1138006, 13077, '<td valign="top">Well composed, but a bit unflattering for the lady.</td>', 'Well composed, but a bit unflattering for the lady.', '2015-01-04 23:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298802, 1137955, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice. Good tight composition and great backlight combined with foreground detail. Would make a very good newspaper shot, does not depend on fine detail to be strong.</td>', 'Nice. Good tight composition and great backlight combined with foreground detail. Would make a very good newspaper shot, does not depend on fine detail to be strong.', '2015-01-04 23:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298804, 1137861, 13077, '<td valign="top">I know the feeling.</td>', 'I know the feeling.', '2015-01-04 23:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
