(7298818, 1137837, 13077, '<td valign="top">Wow, top-notch use of lo-fi. Would make an excellent big print, maybe with the same tones but without the filter showing on the sky.</td>', 'Wow, top-notch use of lo-fi. Would make an excellent big print, maybe with the same tones but without the filter showing on the sky.', '2015-01-04 23:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7298822, 1137985, 104230, '<td valign="top">I wonder if you considered cropping out the left third or so?  Even without those people in the image one immediately assumes this pose is being done for an audience :-) To my eyes, the image would come across more as a portrait that way, and feel less cluttered overall. Nice light on the statue.</td>', 'I wonder if you considered cropping out the left third or so?  Even without those people in the image one immediately assumes this pose is being done for an audience :-) To my eyes, the image would come across more as a portrait that way, and feel less cluttered overall. Nice light on the statue.', '2015-01-04 23:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
