(7298929, 1138003, 98565, '<td valign="top">Congratulations - a wonderful picture!<br/>I can see you in the window taking it! And I''m curious about it: Did she notice you taking her picture? Did you ask her in advance or afterwards? I''m just asking because I was wondering about myself in a situation like this. I would probably not have dared to take this shot (another missed chance...)</td>', 'Congratulations - a wonderful picture!I can see you in the window taking it! And I''m curious about it: Did she notice you taking her picture? Did you ask her in advance or afterwards? I''m just asking because I was wondering about myself in a situation like this. I would probably not have dared to take this shot (another missed chance...)', '2015-01-05 06:25:14.000000', NULL, 0),
