(7299140, 1138011, 19825, '<td valign="top">I really like this image, Nikki. Congrats on the top ten. <br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by nam:</b></div><hr/><i> I agree with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">melethia</a> and wish we could see her eyelashes better. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>If you use Silver Efex Pro there are some simple things you can do in post that might be able to bring out the lashes (e.g., selectively boost structure, fine structure, contrast, black/white levels).</td>', 'I really like this image, Nikki. Congrats on the top ten.  Originally posted by nam: I agree with  melethia and wish we could see her eyelashes better.  If you use Silver Efex Pro there are some simple things you can do in post that might be able to bring out the lashes (e.g., selectively boost structure, fine structure, contrast, black/white levels).', '2015-01-05 16:27:46.000000', NULL, 0),
